message: |
  If you use LLM Skill Factory in research or production, please cite it.
  The DOI below will resolve to the latest GitHub release.
type: software
title: "LLM Skill Factory"
abstract: |
  Domain-agnostic SKILL.md studio with a built-in eval harness. Generates,
  validates, versions, and measures the lift of modular AI-expertise skill
  files (the open SKILL.md standard) over base model output, with bootstrap
  95% confidence intervals and judge self-calibration controls.
